--@prefix xsd : <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

-- TASK 7

<http://example.org/jane> <http://ont.example.org/hasName> "Fred" .
<http://example.org/jane> <http://ont.example.org/hasFriend> "Fredd" .
<http://example.org/jane> <http://ont.example.org/hasName> "Sally" .
<http://example.org/fred> <http://ont.example.org/hasName> "Freed" , "Sally" .
<http://example.org/fred> <http://ont.example.org/hasFriend> "Sally", "Fred" .
<http://example.org/abcd> <http://ont.example.org/hasName> "Abcd" .
<http://example.org/abcd> <http://ont.example.org/hasFriend> "Sallyy" , "Fred" .

-- TASK 8

<http://example.org/jane> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/Person> .
<http://example.org/fred> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/Person> .
<http://example.org/abcd> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/Person> .
<http://example.org/efgh> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/Person> .
<http://example.org/jane> <http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/knows> <http://example.org/nmg> .
<http://example.org/fred> <http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/knows> <http://example.org/nmg> .

-- TASK 9

<http://example.org/alice> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#sameAs> <http://example.org/bob> .

-- <http://example.org/fred> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#sameAs> <http://example.org/jane> .
-- <http://example.org/jane> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#sameAs> <http://example.org/fred> .
-- <http://example.org/jane> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#sameAs> <http://example.org/fred> .
-- <http://example.org/abcd> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#sameAs> <http://example.org/jane> .

-- obj:A <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#sameAs> obj:B .
-- obj:C <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#sameAs> obj:B .
-- obj:B <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#sameAs> obj:D .

